Election Analysis Dashboard using Excel
📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing a recent state election dataset using Microsoft Excel / LibreOffice Calc. The analysis includes party performance, constituency wise winner identification, gender analysis, age analysis, vote share calculation, and interactive dashboard creation.

The project demonstrates practical Excel data analytics skills including:

Data Cleaning
Formula Based Analysis
Pivot Tables
Dashboard Design
Data Visualization
Insight Generation
📊 Dataset Information

The dataset contains synthetic election records with the following columns:

Column Name	Description
Constituency	Name of constituency
State	State name
Party	Political party
Candidate	Candidate name
Votes	Votes received
Total_Votes	Total constituency votes
Gender	Candidate gender
Age	Candidate age
